WEBVTT

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.795
As a Frenchman, I must say

00:01:30.819 --> 00:01:32.867
that there are
a lot of French intellectuals

00:01:32.891 --> 00:01:35.952
that think happiness
is not at all interesting.

00:01:35.976 --> 00:01:36.976
(Laughter)

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.525
I just wrote an essay on happiness,
and there was a controversy.

00:01:40.549 --> 00:01:42.800
And someone wrote an article saying,

00:01:42.824 --> 00:01:45.850
"Don't impose on us
the dirty work of happiness."

00:01:45.874 --> 00:01:46.976
(Laughter)

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.206
"We don't care about being happy.
We need to live with passion.

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:53.581
We like the ups and downs of life.

00:01:53.605 --> 00:01:57.047
We like our suffering because it's so good
when it ceases for a while."

00:01:57.071 --> 00:02:00.642
(Laughter)